{"title":"Ashsworn Pyromancer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 59 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (2.2% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>1,066</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>1,060</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>346</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>37</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>12</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>14</td><td>in the wilds around 214, -1076</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>1,066</td><td>in the wilds around 293, -1102</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>1,060</td><td>in the wilds around 288, -1100</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>346</td><td>in the wilds around 286, -1183</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>37</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>12</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</